# ============================================================
# TAVI Risk Insight — Web environment (EXAMPLE)
# ============================================================
# Copy this file to .env if you need to override defaults.
# .env is gitignored; .env.example is committed.
#
# In dev, leave VITE_API_URL UNSET — Vite proxy on :5173/:5174
# forwards /api/* to the local FastAPI on :8000 (see vite.config.ts).
#
# In production, set VITE_API_URL via your platform's env settings:
#   - Vercel:    Project → Settings → Environment Variables
#   - HF Spaces: Settings → Repository Secrets (then build-time)
# ============================================================

# Production example:
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend.hf.space
